; A cost given to the xact command needs an amount to apply to.  When
; neither the command line nor the account's history supplies one, the
; command reports invalid arguments instead of failing inside the amount
; arithmetic.

2024/01/01 Grocery Store
    Expenses:Food    10 AAPL @ $5.00
    Assets:Cash   $-50.00

test xact 2024/06/15 Nobody to Expenses:Misc '@' '$6.00' from Assets:Cash -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Invalid xact command arguments
end test

test xact 2024/06/15 Nobody to Expenses:Misc '@@' '$6.00' from Assets:Cash -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Invalid xact command arguments
end test
